        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Hey! Here is the vision I have for the website.\n\nThe objective is to create a national brand website for SMASH ROOM that can accommodate multiple locations and support future franchise growth.\n\nPrimary Website:\n[URL_006]\n\nI would like a clean, modern, mobile-friendly design with simplicity comparable to iSmashUSA. The branding should use black, purple, and white, with large images, generous spacing, and straightforward navigation.\n\nSections for the Homepage:\n\nHero Banner\nLocation Selector\nRage Rooms\nAxe Throwing\nSplatter Room\nCorporate Events\nBirthday Parties\nReviews\nFAQ\nContact\n\nThe homepage needs to show visitors our offerings right away and let them choose their location.\n\nLocations at Present:\n\nFairfield, CA\nSan Francisco, CA\nSeattle, WA\n\nEvery location should have a dedicated page of its own, while the design and branding remain consistent across all locations.\n\nThe site should be structured so that future locations can be added easily without requiring a redesign.\n\nPossible future examples:\n\nPhoenix\nDenver\nAustin\nFranchise Locations\n\nOverall, it should feel like a national entertainment brand rather than a local business website."
